# Contract of the encoding callee (hypothesis of vu_char_len_correct):
# reads the byte p points to and gives it back, returns any 32-bit
# value (no range).
VU.thy:127-128
# Contract of the callout callee (hypothesis of
# vu_callout_step_correct): gets the whole args record, gives it back
# with the verified-side state unchanged, result in Q; gets the subject
# (whole: no read-only share) and gives it back unchanged (run B).
VU.thy:207-209
# ... and the definition of "verified-side state unchanged".
VU.thy:51-52
# ... and the subject assertion it lends (run B, read accessor).
VU.thy:61-65
# Contract of the client's apply_all_case_fold (hypothesis of
# vu_fold_all_composed, run B): the client reaches the record only
# through the vu_i_apply it is given, so it preserves every property
# that vu_i_apply preserves. vu_fold_all_composed derives the hypothesis
# of vu_fold_all_correct (record well formed) from it and
# vu_i_apply_correct, so that hypothesis is no longer trusted.
VU.thy:349-356
